  "about": {
    "eyebrow": "About",
    "title": "Built from the basics up.",
    "lede": "A short line about the path that got you here.",
    "storyLabel": "The story",
    "storyHeading": "I started with *one small project*. Now I help teams ship work they're proud of.",
    "story": "Experienced Splunk Administrator managing and troubleshooting production environment issues, ensuring smooth monitoring , administration and resolution of production issues. Skilled in working with Azure-integrated Splunk environments, handling various Azure services like Virtual Machines (VMs), Logic Apps, VMSS, Storage, and network-related services.\n\nProficient in onboarding indexes in Splunk, creating alerts, and configuring saved searches as per stakeholder requirements. Experienced in user access management and enforcing compliance policies to ensure adherence to security standards. I focus on maintaining a stable, responsive environment, adhering to strict timelines to meet stakeholder expectations.\n\nStrong knowledge of Incident, Problem, and Change Management processes, ensuring minimal downtime and swift issue resolution. Skilled in working within multiple team environments, effectively syncing with live progress on requirements. Adept at handling adhoc requirements under pressure and delivering timely solutions for business needs.\n\nPassionate about leveraging my technical expertise and experience to optimize processes, enhance system reliability, and drive business success.",
